# Local AI-agent / IDE directories.
#
# These are mount points for agent runtimes (Monica, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor,
# Kimi, ...). Their contents are materialised per run from the Monica workspace
# skill registry, so a committed copy is never what a run actually loads - it
# only drifts out of date the moment the registry moves on. Anchored with a
# leading "/" so only the repository root matches; unanchored patterns would
# silently ignore a nested directory of the same name.
/.agents/
/.agent_context/
/.aider/
/.augment/
/.beads/
/.claude/
/.cline/
/.clinerules/
/.codebuddy/
/.codegraph/
/.codex/
/.continue/
/.cursor/
/.gemini/
/.kimi/
/.kiro/
/.monica/
/.multica/
/.opencode/
/.roo/
/.serena/
/.trae/
/.windsurf/

